# A Preacher of Doom (CabalBuffer) curses a character of Dusk while Dawn leads the Seven Signs,
# as in cabal_buffer_preacher_curse.scenario, but its landing rolls are pinned to 99: the curse
# is resisted, and the character feels nothing.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (CabalBuffer.java); the reference probe
# cannot pin the world's landing roll.
character Seeker 20
cabal dusk gnosis
festival 100 0
random 50 0
script script.feature.CabalBuffer
npc preacher 31093 Folk 100 0 0
roll preacher 99

tick x4
  S NpcSay obj=preacher type=0 npc=1031093 text="You don't have any hope! Your end has come!"
  S MagicSkillUse caster=preacher target=player skill=4361-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
